description:
Welcome to Noob Incremental! A massive Incremental game with hundreds of Upgrades, dozens of Stats, multiple Prestige layers, and many Features to explore! ✨

How to play:
🤓 Buy Noobs and make Oof!
⚡ Buy Upgrades and be Stronger!
🍀 Roll Runes and Level them up!
🔥 Prestige and unlock new content!
🏆 Reach the top and become the ultimate Noob!

💎 Roblox Plus players get +10% Oof and +10% Prism!
💖 Join the Group and Like the game for +10% Rune Speed!
🎉 Join the Community Server for +10% Rune Luck!

👥 Credits
@GhoulaxDev - Owner & Programmer
@Tehleat - Builder
@0hxsn - UI Designer
@Zyfley - Balancer
@0wknh - Some VFX
@PurpleDevMusic - Few Musics

New map expansion, 1 new remodel and 1 new car!

Version: Alpha v.1.1.

• Over 180+ unique cars to buy! 
• Great car customization!
• Advanced tuning!
• 7 different maps! 
• Challenge different players! 
__
MRT is a racing sim-cade where you can buy and customize between 180+ different unique cars to drive in a virtual recreation of Tokyo, Japan with its large highways and twisting mountain passes. Upgrade and modify your vehicle to advance in the ranks, communicate with your friends and compete with other players for money and status! This game is still in development. Expect bugs and unfinished features.

Follow the devs!
@bigcrazycarboy - https://www.roblox.com/users/29794179
