Welcome to the nature trail! Explore sprawling meadows, high mountains, and creepy caves. Equipped with your trusty backpack and keen observational skills, scour the landscape for animals that hold the key to unlocking cool prizes—and the next stage of your adventure! 

🐞🐻🔍 Seek & Find Animals 🔍🐻🐞 
